cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or package, please cite the dataset record below."
type: software
title: "RED-2400 Reader"
abstract: >-
  Python reader for the RED-2400 public benchmark (6,660 rejection events,
  Zenodo concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.19989074). Version 0.1.0 (May 2026) is
  a legacy reader for the May 2026 JSON-lines file; the current RED-2400
  files are CSV.
